onse text may still contain business data.", "请求未收到 HTTP 响应：": "No HTTP response received:", "可能是网络中断、服务不可达或浏览器拦截；浏览器未提供服务端状态。操作是否已执行需要核对，未自动重发。": "The network, service or browser may have blocked the request. No server status is available. Verify whether the action ran before retrying; it was not resent automatically.", "响应读取中断：": "Response reading interrupted:", "这是 Codex 运行事件，不代表页面到 RunDesk 的 HTTP 请求返回了同样的状态。": "This is a Codex runtime event, not necessarily the status of the browser's HTTP request to RunDesk.", "上次记录": "Last recorded", " · 运行环境": " · Runtime", "固定版本": "Pinned version", "部署于": "Deployed at", " · 镜像与构建": " · Images & builds", "固定 Image ID · ": "Pinned image ID · ", "只读轨迹工具仅用于此分析会话；沿用原配置的模型与认证。原任务单独运行。": "Read-only trace tools are scoped to this analysis conversation, using the original model and authentication. The original task runs separately.", "total 是累计用量，last 是最近一轮的用量；均不代表完整上下文快照。耗时包含启动和等待审批。": "total is cumulative usage; last is usage for the latest turn. Neither is a full context snapshot. Duration includes startup and approval waits.", "例如 project-guide": "e.g. project-guide", "例如 filesystem": "e.g. filesystem", "已有密钥以 [redacted] 隐藏，保留它可沿用原值。MCP 命令在运行 Codex 的主机上执行。": "Existing secrets appear as [redacted]; keep this marker to retain their values. MCP commands run on the Codex host.", "合并导入，保留其他服务。env/http_headers 的密钥会隐藏；新环境需要补充。参数和 URL 中的敏感内容仍需自行检查。": "Merge while preserving other servers. Secrets in env/http_headers are masked and must be supplied in a new environment. Review arguments and URLs for sensitive data.", "检查工作区读写、Codex、沙箱实际执行及 App Server 接口，不调用模型。": "Check workspace access, Codex, sandbox execution and app-server interfaces without invoking a model.", "单用户后台；workspace-write 沙箱、on-request 审批。浏览器关闭后任务继续；后台退出则中断当前运行。": "Tasks use the configured sandbox and approval policy. Closing the browser does not stop work; stopping the server interrupts active runs.", "模型与认证页可查看登录状态和登录命令。模型在创建会话时确定。": "See Model & authentication for sign-in status and commands. The model is chosen when creating a conversation.", "删除此会话及 RunDesk 事件记录？原生 Codex 线程、上传文件和产物会保留。": "Delete this conversation and its RunDesk events? Native Codex threads, uploads and outputs will remain.", "例如：视觉助手": "e.g. Vision assistant", "点击读取当前实例的登录状态。": "Read the sign-in status for this configuration.", "当前实例": "Current configuration", "独立 Codex 配置目录；此实例可以在多个工作区创建会话。": "Separate Codex configuration directory; conversations can use multiple workspaces.", "默认实例沿用启动 RunDesk 时的 CODEX_HOME 和原有会话。": "The default configuration uses the service's CODEX_HOME and existing conversations.", "实例名称": "Configuration name", "新会话默认模型": "Default model for new conversations", "已读取模型，选择后保存实例": "Models loaded. Select one and save the configuration.", "保存实例": "Save configuration", "实例已保存；权限将在下一轮生效，默认模型用于新会话": "Saved. Permissions apply next turn; the default model applies to new conversations.", "配置目录：": "Configuration directory:", "会话创建后固定绑定实例与工作区。实例共用本机操作系统用户；全局技能、项目文件和服务环境变量仍可能共享。": "Conversations are bound to their configuration and workspace. Native configurations share the OS account; global skills, project files and service environment variables may also be shared.", "登录与重新加载": "Sign in & reload", "新实例需要配置凭据。请以运行后台的系统用户，在终端执行对应命令；登录完成后重新加载空闲连接。": "Configure credentials under the service's OS account using the command below, then reload idle connections.", "Ubuntu / macOS 登录命令": "Ubuntu / macOS sign-in command", "Windows PowerShell 登录命令": "Windows PowerShell sign-in command", "如后台使用 --codex 指定可执行文件，请将命令中的 codex 替换为该路径。凭据存储由 Codex 管理；使用系统密钥环时不保证账号隔离。": "Replace codex with your configured executable path if needed. Codex manages credential storage; an OS keychain does not guarantee account isolation.", "重新加载空闲连接": "Reload idle connections", "新建实例": "New configuration", "创建独立配置目录，然后在 Skills 和 MCP 页配置这个助手。": "Create a separate configuration directory, then configure Skills and MCP.", "创建并切换": "Create and switch", "已创建实例：": "Configuration created:", "网络中断，提交状态可能尚未确认。请刷新任务列表核对后再重试。": "Connection lost; submission may be unconfirmed. Refresh the task list and verify before retrying.", " · 请求 ": " · Request ", "可执行 · 任务与文件在项目内共享": "Can run · Tasks and files are shared within the project", "只读 · 可以查看任务、过程和文件": "Read only · View tasks, activity and files", "附件：": "Attachments:", "已检查请求内容，允许本次操作？": "Have you reviewed the request and want to allow this operation?", "此类请求请联系管理员处理。": "Contact an administrator to handle this request.", " · 文件已删除": " · File deleted", "项目或会话已改变，请重新选择": "Project or conversation changed. Select again.", "个附件": "attachments", "会话状态已变化，请重新选择当前失败任务。": "Conversation status changed. Select the current failed task again.", "记录只说明观察到的步骤和路径；应用中的实际结果还需要核对。": "Records describe observed steps and paths; verify actual results in the application.", "尚未记录工具步骤或会话产物；这不代表外部操作一定没有发生。": "No tool steps or artifacts recorded. External actions may still have occurred.", "记录较多，这里只展示部分，请在原任务过程中继续核对。": "Only part of the record is shown. Review the original task for more.", "将在原会话新增一轮，沿用此会话的模型和当前应用配置。Codex 会先检查已有结果，再继续剩余工作。": "Add a turn to the original conversation using its model and current application settings. Codex reviews existing results before continuing.", "例如：草稿已保存；发布动作尚未执行。": "e.g. Draft saved; publishing has not run.", "当前任务已变化，请关闭窗口并选择失败任务。": "The current task changed. Close this dialog and select the failed task.", "再次核对原生状态并提交继续请求…": "Rechecking native state and submitting the resume request…", "已在原会话继续；原失败轮次仍保留在过程中。": "Resumed in the original conversation. The failed turn remains in the history.", "。可重试同一请求以确认回执，沿用原请求编号。": ". Retry the same request ID to confirm its receipt.", "。请重新核对恢复条件。": ". Review recovery conditions again.", "先核对已有结果，再继续未完成的部分。": "Review existing results before continuing unfinished work.", "将提交下面的精确规则。命令规则不等于信任整个目录；后续命令仍可能需要审批。": "The exact rule below will be submitted. A command rule does not trust the whole directory; later commands may still require approval.", "服务端没有提供可用决定。可用对话顶部的停止按钮中止任务。": "The server provided no available decision. Use Stop at the top of the conversation to interrupt the task.", "完整访问会移除文件和网络沙箱边界；执行仍受系统用户权限与服务端要求约束。": "Full access removes file and network sandbox boundaries. OS account permissions and server requirements still apply.", "不请求审批不会扩大沙箱权限。超出边界的操作可能直接失败。": "Never ask does not expand sandbox permissions. Operations outside its boundaries may fail.", "默认在沙箱内执行。自动审查由 Codex 提供，可能增加模型调用，服务端也可能拒绝此配置。": "Execution normally uses the sandbox. Codex automatic review may add model calls and can be rejected by the server.", "保存后在该助手或应用各会话的下一轮生效；正在执行或等待审批的任务保持原配置。不会修改你的 config.toml。生效值以 App Server 返回为准。": "Applies from the next turn in this assistant/application. Running or approval-waiting tasks keep their settings. This does not change config.toml; app-server reports effective values.", "会话尚未收到运行配置。启动任务后显示 App Server 返回的生效值。": "No runtime configuration received yet. Start a task to see effective values from app-server.", "此连接尚未记录告警；不代表所有工具已验证。": "No alerts recorded for this connection. This does not verify every tool.", "显示最近 50 个连接。告警按连接去重，旧连接记录保留时间标记。": "Shows the latest 50 connections. Alerts are deduplicated per connection; historical records retain timestamps.", "还没有连接记录。运行诊断后可查看启动告警。": "No connection records. Run diagnostics to inspect startup alerts.", "按指定时区提交独立任务。暂停队列只暂停执行，定时任务仍会入队。": "Submit independent tasks in the chosen time zone. Pausing the queue stops execution, but scheduled tasks still enter it.", "删除这个定时规则？已经提交的任务会保留。": "Delete this schedule? Already submitted tasks will remain.", "例如 news-research": "e.g. news-research", " · 可执行": " · Executable", "普通对话、队列任务和等待审批的任务共同占用额度。降低上限不会终止正在执行的任务。": "Conversations, queued tasks and approval-waiting tasks share capacity. Lowering the limit does not stop running tasks.", "队列任务 · ": "Queued task · ", "记录提交给 Codex 的技能，不代表已经执行。": "Records skills submitted to Codex, not proof of execution.", "原生 Codex 通知；未新建任务轮次。": "Native Codex notification; no new task turn was created.", "接口只报告完成事件，未提供开始时间。": "The interface reported completion only, without a start time.", "回复摘录 · ": "Response excerpt · ", "本轮已中断或失败，未记录最终回复。": "This turn was interrupted or failed without a final response.", "尚未记录最终回复，可展开查看已有步骤。": "No final response recorded. Expand to inspect existing steps.", "没有匹配的轮次。可以清空搜索或关闭筛选。": "No matching turns. Clear the search or disable filters.", "尚未开始。发送问题后，实际发生的过程会出现在这里。": "Not started. Send a question to see the actual process here.", "打开分析会话 · ": "Open analysis conversation · ", "发送问题后，实际执行的步骤会出现在这里。": "Send a question to see actual execution steps here.", "没有匹配的步骤。可以调整筛选条件。": "No matching steps. Adjust the filters.", "尚未开始。这里会保留成功、失败和中断的过程。": "Not started. Successful, failed and interrupted processes will be retained here.", "完整记录读取失败，可刷新重试：": "Could not read the full record. Refresh to retry:", "这一轮已中断或失败，尚未记录最终回复。已发生的步骤仍可查看。": "This turn was interrupted or failed without a final response. Existing steps remain available.", "执行已结束，但没有记录最终回复。可以检查步骤，或继续提问。": "Execution ended without a final response. Inspect the steps or ask a follow-up question.", "尚未记录回复，执行过程会持续更新。": "No response recorded yet. Execution progress continues to update.", "页面显示前 200,000 字符；可下载完整事件。": "Shows the first 200,000 characters. Download the complete events for the full content.", "当前记录中未发现工具返回的网址。这不等于没有查询结果；可检查工具的原始返回。": "No URLs found in recorded tool outputs. This does not mean there were no results; inspect the raw outputs.", "这里展示调用与返回记录。是否找到目标，需要结合返回内容和身份依据判断。": "Shows calls and outputs. Whether the target was found depends on the returned evidence and identity checks.", "工具返回了空列表。记录未说明是无匹配项、覆盖不足还是访问受限，请结合其他输出判断。": "The tool returned an empty list. This record does not distinguish no matches, incomplete coverage or restricted access; review other evidence.", "显示前 100,000 字符；可下载完整事件。": "Shows the first 100,000 characters. Download complete events for the full content.", "缺少完整边界或时间有冲突，不推定完整耗时。": "Boundaries are incomplete or timestamps conflict; no full duration is inferred.", "完整事件包含工具参数和输出；导出前请检查敏感信息。": "Complete events include tool arguments and outputs. Review sensitive content before exporting.", "分析会话已创建，可从会话列表打开。": "Analysis conversation created. Open it from conversation history.", "分析会话已创建，问题尚未确认发送；可在此重试。": "Analysis conversation created; question delivery is unconfirmed. Retry here.", "未完成创建，问题已保留：": "Creation incomplete; your question is preserved:", "读取失败，已显示的记录保留：": "Read failed; displayed records are preserved:", "请先发起一次对话或选择已有任务。": "Start a conversation or select an existing task first.", "事件预览与可见过程；完整事件可按 refs 单独下载，不包含隐藏推理。": "Event previews and visible process. Complete events can be downloaded by reference; hidden reasoning is not included.", "用户编号 · ": "User ID · ", "停用此用户？旧登录立即失效；已接受的任务不会自动取消。": "Disable this user? Existing logins expire immediately; accepted tasks are not canceled.", "生成新的个人访问码？旧访问码和全部旧登录将失效。": "Generate a new access code? The old code and all existing logins will expire.", "先为应用创建独立项目环境，再创建用户并授权。不同用户可共享同一项目，或使用不同项目隔离数据。": "Create application project environments, then add users and grant access. Users can share projects or use separate projects for data isolation.", "管理员维护运行配置；成员在获授权的应用项目中查看或执行任务。": "Administrators manage runtime settings. Members view or run tasks in authorized application projects.", "同一应用项目的成员可查看该项目的应用任务与文件。需要独立数据时，先创建不同项目环境。通用助手与运行配置暂仅管理员可用。": "Project members can view its application tasks and files. Use separate project environments for isolated data. The general assistant and runtime settings are administrator-only.", "还没有应用项目环境。可先创建账号，稍后分配项目。": "No application project environments yet. Create accounts now and assign projects later.", "只读：查看任务、过程和项目文件。可执行：另外允许新建任务、继续、停止、上传与处理审批。修改授权会使旧登录失效。": "Read only: view tasks, activity and project files. Can run: also create, resume and stop tasks, upload files and handle approvals. Permission changes expire existing logins.", " 的访问码只在这里显示一次。请自行交给对应用户。": "'s access code is shown here once. Share it directly with the intended user.", "用户打开同一 RunDesk 地址，在登录页输入此码。丢失后可重置；不要分享管理员令牌。": "Users enter this code at the RunDesk login page. Reset it if lost; do not share the administrator token.", "---\nname: project-guide\ndescription: 本项目的工作约定\n---\n\n在修改代码前，先阅读 README，并说明验证方式。\n": "---\nname: project-guide\ndescription: Project working conventions\n---\n\nRead README before editing code and explain how changes will be verified.\n", "版本、源码和提交信息读取 org.opencontainers.image.* 标签；预装能力读取 io.rundesk.* 标签。示例 Dockerfile 和 IMAGES.md 提供完整约定。Image ID 是本机镜像身份，仓库 Digest 单独展示，二者不混用。": "Version, source and revision use org.opencontainers.image.* labels; bundled capabilities use io.rundesk.*. See the example Dockerfile and IMAGES.md. Local image IDs and repository digests are shown separately.", "0 条事件": "0 events", "RunDesk · 我的应用项目": "RunDesk · My application projects", "← 我的项目": "← My projects", "上下文": "Context", "事件": "Events", "事件内容关键词": "Search event contents", "事件分类": "Event category", "事件方向": "Event direction", "产物": "Artifacts", "会话操作": "Conversation actions", "会话能力": "Conversation capabilities", "会话范围": "Conversation scope", "会话运行状态": "Conversation runtime status", "全部类型": "All types", "关闭会话能力": "Close capabilities", "关闭调试台": "Close diagnostics", "关闭运行状态": "Close runtime status", "关闭配置": "Close settings", "删除会话": "Delete conversation", "助手与应用": "Assistant & applications", "协作 · RunDesk": "Collaboration · RunDesk", "复制对话": "Copy conversation", "审批": "Approvals", "导出 JSONL ↓": "Export JSONL ↓", "导出 Markdown": "Export Markdown", "展示 App Server 实际事件。完整模型请求与内部推理不一定由接口公开。": "Actual app-server events. Full model requests and internal reasoning may not be exposed by the interface.", "应用 /": "Applications /", "开始": "Start", "开始时间": "Start time", "所有方向": "All directions", "描述要完成的任务…": "Describe the task…", "搜索会话": "Search conversations", "文件预览": "File preview", "方法名": "Method", "方法名，如 turn/": "Method, e.g. turn/", "时间范围": "Time range", "查看执行过程": "View execution process", "查看请求与运行错误": "View request 