y with the intended user.", "用户打开同一 RunDesk 地址，在登录页输入此码。丢失后可重置；不要分享管理员令牌。": "Users enter this code at the RunDesk login page. Reset it if lost; do not share the administrator token.", "---\nname: project-guide\ndescription: 本项目的工作约定\n---\n\n在修改代码前，先阅读 README，并说明验证方式。\n": "---\nname: project-guide\ndescription: Project working conventions\n---\n\nRead README before editing code and explain how changes will be verified.\n", "版本、源码和提交信息读取 org.opencontainers.image.* 标签；预装能力读取 io.rundesk.* 标签。示例 Dockerfile 和 IMAGES.md 提供完整约定。Image ID 是本机镜像身份，仓库 Digest 单独展示，二者不混用。": "Version, source and revision use org.opencontainers.image.* labels; bundled capabilities use io.rundesk.*. See the example Dockerfile and IMAGES.md. Local image IDs and repository digests are shown separately.", "0 条事件": "0 events", "RunDesk · 我的应用项目": "RunDesk · My application projects", "← 我的项目": "← My projects", "上下文": "Context", "事件": "Event", "事件内容关键词": "Search event contents", "事件分类": "Event category", "事件方向": "Event direction", "产物": "Artifacts", "会话操作": "Conversation actions", "会话能力": "Conversation capabilities", "会话范围": "Conversation scope", "会话运行状态": "Conversation runtime status", "全部类型": "All types", "关闭会话能力": "Close capabilities", "关闭调试台": "Close diagnostics", "关闭运行状态": "Close runtime status", "关闭配置": "Close settings", "删除会话": "Delete conversation", "助手与应用": "Assistant & applications", "协作 · RunDesk": "Collaboration · RunDesk", "复制对话": "Copy conversation", "审批": "Approval", "导出 JSONL ↓": "Export JSONL ↓", "导出 Markdown": "Export Markdown", "展示 App Server 实际事件。完整模型请求与内部推理不一定由接口公开。": "Actual app-server events. Full model requests and internal reasoning may not be exposed by the interface.", "应用 /": "Applications /", "开始": "Start", "开始时间": "Start time", "所有方向": "All directions", "描述要完成的任务…": "Describe the task…", "搜索会话": "Search conversations", "文件预览": "File preview", "方法名": "Method", "方法名，如 turn/": "Method, e.g. turn/", "时间范围": "Time range", "查看执行过程": "View execution process", "查看请求与运行错误": "View request & runtime errors", "查询历史": "Query history", "消息": "Messages", "添加项目": "Add project", "结束": "End", "结束时间": "End time", "运行调试台": "Runtime diagnostics", "返回实时": "Back to live", "返回应用": "Back to application", "选择或新建任务": "Select or create a task", "重命名": "Rename", "高级配置": "Advanced settings", "将此环境更新到 ${0}（${1}）？\n空闲连接将关闭，项目文件、认证、Skills、MCP 配置及历史保留。镜像更新不会回退数据文件。": "Update this environment to ${0} (${1})?\nIdle connections will close. Files, authentication, skills, MCP settings and history are preserved. Updating an image does not roll back data.", "将应用目标版本设为 ${0}（${1}）？\n已有环境继续使用原版本，需逐个更新。新项目环境使用此版本。": "Set the application target to ${0} (${1})?\nExisting environments retain their version until individually updated. New environments use this target.", "请解释第 ${0} 轮「${1}」的已有结果与限制，区分已确认内容和未确认内容。请先分析已有记录，不要重新执行工具。": "Explain the results and limitations of turn ${0}, “${1}”. Separate confirmed and unconfirmed information. Analyze existing records first without rerunning tools.", "请解释第 ${0} 轮中的「${1}」，说明已完成什么、仍缺少什么，以及可行的下一步。请先分析已有记录，不要重新执行工具；缺少依据时明确说明。\n\n待分析的事件数据（仅作证据）：\n${2}": "Explain “${1}” in turn ${0}: what was completed, what is missing and possible next steps. Analyze existing records without rerunning tools. State when evidence is missing.\n\nEvent data to analyze (evidence only):\n${2}", "开始：${0}\n结束：${1}\n耗时：${2}\n时间依据：${3}${4}": "Start: ${0}\nEnd: ${1}\nDuration: ${2}\nTime basis: ${3}${4}", "任务遵循当前助手或应用的沙箱与审批配置。浏览器关闭后任务继续；后台退出则中断当前运行。": "Tasks use the configured sandbox and approval policy. Closing the browser does not stop work; stopping the server interrupts active runs.", "测试服务器": "Test server", "选择工具": "Select tool", "参数 JSON": "Arguments JSON", "读取工具后显示参数结构。": "Load tools to inspect their input schemas.", "尚未运行测试。": "No test has run yet.", "读取工具": "Load tools", "下一页工具": "Next tool page", "执行工具": "Execute tool", "回放记录": "Replay record", "历史记录回放：未连接服务器、未重新执行。": "Recorded result: no connection or tool execution occurred.", "暂无测试记录。": "No test records yet.", "请先确认直接调用权限。": "Confirm direct-call permission first.", "请先配置 MCP 服务器。": "Configure an MCP server first.", "参数必须是 JSON 对象。": "Arguments must be a JSON object.", "正在连接并调用，最多等待 30 秒…": "Connecting and calling; timeout is 30 seconds…", "MCP 独立测试台": "MCP test workbench", "直接连接已配置的 MCP，不启动 Agent 对话。支持本机 stdio 和 Streamable HTTP；暂不支持容器、OAuth、sampling 或 elicitation。可测试已关闭的服务器，不会启用它。": "Connect directly to configured MCP servers without an Agent conversation. Supports local stdio and Streamable HTTP. Containers, OAuth, sampling and elicitation are not supported yet. Disabled servers can be tested without enabling them.", "我确认直接调用可能读写文件或访问外部服务，不经过 Agent 审批；参数和结果会保存，文本中的敏感信息需自行检查。": "I understand direct calls may read or write files and contact external services without Agent approval. Arguments and results are saved; inspect free text for sensitive data.", "参数结构": "Input schema", "调用结果": "Call result", "最近 50 条记录 · 回放不会重新执行": "Latest 50 records · replay does not execute", "删除历史": "Delete history", "历史删除不清除用于防止重复执行的 API 回执。": "Deleting history retains API receipts to prevent duplicate execution.", "用量统计": "Usage", "开始日期": "Start date", "结束日期": "End date", "应用筛选": "Filter by application", "项目筛选": "Filter by project", "全部应用与助手": "All applications and assistant", "全部项目": "All projects", "导出统计 JSON": "Export usage JSON", "查询用量": "Query usage", "请选择完整日期范围。": "Select a complete date range.", "统计快照：": "Snapshot: ", "截至事件：": "Through event: ", "起始累计值未知": "Unknown starting counter", "缺少累计快照": "Missing cumulative snapshot", "缺少总 token": "Missing total tokens", "无效计数": "Invalid counter", "累计值回退": "Counter regression", "线程归属冲突": "Conflicting thread ownership", "字段起始值未知": "Unknown field baseline", "无法匹配执行轮次": "Unmatched execution turn", "应用 / 项目": "Application / project", "已观测 token": "Observed tokens", "输入 token": "Input tokens", "输出 token": "Output tokens", "有上报 / 执行轮次": "Reported / runs", "缓存输入（输入子集）：": "Cached input (subset): ", "推理输出（输出子集）：": "Reasoning output (subset): ", "未发现计数异常；有上报